# ─── Audited third-party repositories (2.2 GB) ────────────────────────────────
# QM, Hermes Agent and Ruflo were cloned for the source-level audit. They are other
# people's code with their own history and licences — never commit them.
# Recreate with the pinned commits recorded in research/notes/01-git-forensics.md:
#   git clone --filter=blob:none https://github.com/yc-software/qm.git
#   git clone --filter=blob:none https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent.git
#   git clone --filter=blob:none https://github.com/ruvnet/ruflo.git
research/repos/

# ─── Hands-on install artifacts (1.2 GB) ──────────────────────────────────────
# node_modules, venvs and workspaces created while driving the audited systems.
research/runs/

# ─── Dependencies / build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ─── Runtime state — never source ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Event-log databases, WAL/SHM sidecars, workspace shadow repos.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
.harness/
shadow.git/
*shadow.git/

# ─── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Credentials are passed by environment variable only. Nothing here should ever exist.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets.json

# ─── Scratch / editor / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_*.mjs
_*.json
_*.md
*.tmp
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# npm pack output — build artifact, never committed
*.tgz

# ─── E4 evaluation results — measurement output, never committed ──────────────
v0/eval/results/

# ─── Never committed (P0, 2026-09-29) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# raw chat transcripts — contain secrets
conversations/
# archify diagram output
archify-out/
# live-gate fixtures and homes created by test runs
v0/tests/wg-fixtures/
v0/tests/wg-homes/
# per-run test output — churns on every suite run
v0/tests/results-*.json
v0/tests/crash-matrix.json
# per-machine Claude Code settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# drafts kept locally, not part of the record
research/productization/wave6-prompt.draft.md
research/productization/worktree-state.md
